 & +\phi_{Zjc}\left(Z_{ic}E_{itc}\right)+\psi_{Sjc}\left(S_{ikc}T_{itc}\right)+\psi_{Zjc}\left(Z_{ic}T_{itc}\right)\big]+\lambda_{tc}+X_{itc}\delta_{c}+\varepsilon_{itc}\,.
